error[V2105]: `http.tls` reads `var.perRunDir`, which has no value when the run starts
  --> vibranium.config.yaml:19:15
   |
19 |         cert: ${var.perRunDir}/partner.crt
   |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   = help: `var.runDir` needs `run`; `http.tls` is read once when the run starts, so the vars it reads may read only `var`, `secret` and `env`
